<title>UK: Energy signs Indian power deal with HDC.</title>
<headline>Energy signs Indian power deal with HDC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Energy Group said on Wednesday it had signed an agreement with India's Hindustan Development Corporation Ltd to jointly develop a 500 megawatt power station and lignite mine in the western Indian state of Rajasthan.</p>
</text>
